", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wh0QWt6mMGoQ7kNvwHUCQPZ&_nc_oc=AdpH5ejreEyAEb3nmXh3-u9dHYNQyhoiHT5rM6GPlVTfaRwiAtlakFeKDQU30BctUEI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5jl3QahoU19i1_-pjqjHcVTIIXwCIQGtHSldmyHn__1A&oe=6A1AE879"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uLmZyEanBRsQ7kNvwHawCXO&_nc_oc=AdrJoOAG1VHt9fr9cxmxJ__ToSr1SLl9HjNazLSIUIrd4KcWCch45dxPHVpWvlqXNuU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6kOu26n7yE1m4htgW2yJOVL3yjg-WBXfgBect943VwLw&oe=6A1AFF4B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IBrOBAhqodkQ7kNvwEwAK3z&_nc_oc=AdpC90SHH0KFDKq0NsK0AhhbkBgoXsDYSj9kG1BpjkOAwaUHgoOcq9uoy67vmlqnN5Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5_JfZkTrWQRXiC4Kmxb64HnQY0fl_59RZBVAvWwrJ80w&oe=6A1AFDCE"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel